## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical CGO memory ownership, lifetime management, and cross-language synchronization. It also checks handling of opaque C handles and resource finalization in Go.

## Key Concepts
- CGO memory ownership and string lifetimes
- Synchronization between Go goroutines and C APIs
- Managing opaque C handles with proper cleanup
- Finalizers for deterministic teardown in Go

## Code Example
